MISSION 1:
The Beginning of the War
------------------------
Date: 11.8.2078

The Golem's packs have set up a base
near El Paso in New Mexico. Mostly
organic creatures have settled there.
Your first task is to give the hordes
of evil a good kick in the ass. But
spare the civilians, you could at
least try! Good luck.

MISSION 2:
Further Confrontation
---------------------
Date: 16.8.2078

So far so good. The enemy now knows
what's going on and has reacted
accordingly, as our scouts report. The
packs of Sino'oh'lar, the planet of
the adversary, have had the cheek to
assimilate some Mexican warships.
Expect to be attacked with earthly
weapons. Push on into the crisis area!

MISSION 3:
Annihilating the Packs on Earth
-------------------------------
Date: 19.8.2078

Now it's blow upon blow! Your goal is
to clear out the base in El Paso for
good. Rumor has it that an
archaeologist called Indigo Jonas has
seen a monstrous beast in this area.
Show the brute what we earthlings are
made of. May a better fate be granted
to you than to Balduron and his men.

MISSION 4:
Advance on Sino'oh'lar
----------------------
Stardate: 745302.6

Well done, the invaders on Earth have
been wiped out! Thanks to an
incredible singularity technology we
discovered in the base near El Paso,
we can teleport you directly to
Sino'oh'lar, the planet of malice and
destruction. It works the other way
around too. May Ezekiel know what
awaits you there.

MISSION 5:
Fight the Beasts of Damnation
-----------------------------
Stardate: 745304.8

The Golem has built his defenses
mostly from machines, since his
organic vermin failed so miserably on
Earth. You can already feel the black,
anti-auric energy drifting like a
shadow of eternal darkness over the
undead planet. Remember: only the
penitent man will pass!

MISSION 6:
The Golem, Ruler of Horror
--------------------------
Stardate: 666.666

You feel the dark power coming at you,
thirsting for you, you hear the voices
of the undead whose souls roast in
hell forever, a gurgling laugh wants
to escape your throat as you realize
that the die is cast: either you and
the universe, or the Golem and the
DARK PLANET! May Balduron and his men
be avenged, and in the bloodiest way!

THE END
-------
Stardate: 745305.2

Victory! You have saved the planet
Earth and preserved mankind from doom!
But don't get too big-headed about it,
Superman has done it a hundred times.
Balduron and his men are now avenged
and the balance between good and evil
is restored. With a smile you watch
the planet Sino'oh'lar slowly begin to
glow and the Golem, with a terrible
roar full of death agony, spew out his
undead soul.
On behalf of the Earth's population,
who vegetated along without a clue,
you can congratulate yourself!
And remember:
Only the penitent man will pass!



By the way: have you found the cheat
yet?




